{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small mistake on vacation can lead to big trouble. Are you ready for it? Are you ready to face the Beaver who\u2019s out for revenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't Mess With Bober</strong> \u2013 a first-person game with a touch of 80s horror movies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177010/extras/TrashRabbit.gif?t=1751347606\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tired of the city hustle, the main character heads to a countryside cabin to relax and unwind.<br>Get ready to face the consequences of a small misdeed that leads to serious trouble.<br>Dive into the mystery held by the river and the dam...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A walking simulator with extra mechanics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">River fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hide-and-seek and chase mechanics with the beaver</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177010/extras/MiniGame.gif?t=1751347606\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A beaver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A walk in the fresh air (at least in the game)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30\u201360 minutes</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3177010?t=1751347606","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3177010?t=1751347606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a